  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "金融職涯與證照規劃",
    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL CAREER AND CERTIFICATE PLANNING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程預計引導財金學生做金融職涯規劃，並敦促其準備相關證照與考試；學生將知道那些職業需要金融專業，需要準備哪些相關證照與考試，被要求有實際行動。",
    "describe_eh": "This course intends to guide students to plan personal financial careers, and encourage them to prepare for related certificates and exams. Students will know what jobs need financial profession, and that these jobs need which certificates and exam pass. Students are required to take action on their careers.",
